# Chuan hoa xuong dong: LF cho moi file van ban, khong phu thuoc core.autocrlf.
# Ly do: may Windows nay dat core.autocrlf=true, khien git checkout ra CRLF con
# gofmt/go luon dung LF -> moi lan `git status`/`gofmt -l` bao nhieu that ma noi
# dung y het. Ep LF dut diem tieng on do.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Ngoai le: file batch Windows (.bat/.cmd) giu CRLF. cmd.exe doc file theo byte,
# vai cau truc nhieu dong (goto/if long nhau) co the loi neu la LF. Du an nay dung
# server tren VPS Windows bang cac .bat (run.bat, script cai dat 1-5) nen giu CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Nhi phan: khong dong xuong dong. part.bin la du lieu sprite nhan vat nhung.
*.bin binary
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
